  "2026-08-03T11:08:05.494Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-03: searched all statuses for session topic automatic infer provenance, infer session topic from work items, automatic session role detection, agent session semantic attribution, and semantic session topic role claimed work inference. Closed pm-rbg1qo owns declaration and propagation, open pm-eq9dlw owns the invalid boolean role signal, open pm-lu6sca owns resolver outcome semantics, and open pm-1wiugq owns corpus coverage instrumentation; none owns automatic semantic inference from claimed work."
  "2026-08-03T11:11:51.123Z","harness:codex","Correction 2026-08-03: the first create-time census statement incorrectly said role coverage was zero. The exact post-mutation all-history projection is 43,787 events: model 0, effort 702, role 37, topic 0. Current description and why-now now carry the corrected values; immutable history preserves both the error and this correction."
  "2026-08-04T09:18:06.053Z","harness:codex","Fresh semantic-attribution evidence 2026-08-04: a no-override Codex plan mutation records harness and instance automatically but no role or topic. The claimed audit plan already supplies a bounded semantic source for both fields, so the absence is observable on the exact workflow this feature targets. No per-command author or environment override was needed or used."
